{"title":"1983 AIME Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AIME_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/0/8/d08d463423e25c1987700ffa956d2dec390a2d40.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x)=|x-p|+|x-15|+|x-p-15|$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"307\" height=\"18\" />, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/d/a/ddaa43e22a414368b1e9ade9e9b5b1328ee7e51b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0 &lt; p &lt; 15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"84\" height=\"16\" />. Determine the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Minimum\" title=\"Minimum\">minimum</a> value taken by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/6/c96dd6ec1dc4ad7520fbdc78fcdbec9edd068d0c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"37\" height=\"20\" /> for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> in the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Interval\" title=\"Interval\">interval</a> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/0/4/804ade616a337557e1eb8c4bc5b90789f4a0b6e5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p \\leq x\\leq15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"86\" height=\"16\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AIME_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>It is best to get rid of the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Absolute_value\" title=\"Absolute value\">absolute values</a> first. \n</p><p>Under the given circumstances, we notice that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/1/e2180591307693c12f6559277a715a8f81665b2d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|x-p|=x-p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"117\" height=\"18\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/5/e/05e131c38aba0cf2a3335f59fc00e6e277c225ea.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|x-15|=15-x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"135\" height=\"18\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/f/e/cfec901d21a75127d4464be61fc12a6016d50624.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|x-p-15|=15+p-x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"198\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p>Adding these together, we find that the sum is equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/3/853ed3a59eb7a55adf297255899a9a263c02ec11.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$30-x$\" width=\"50\" height=\"12\" />, which attains its minimum value (on the given interval <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/e/f3ed5f287822155aed10bebd3f14de8b9b102827.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p \\leq x \\leq 15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"86\" height=\"16\" />) when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/4/5/e45a63c78330a7020ad39fd035c818528f54ff46.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=15$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"52\" height=\"13\" />, giving a minimum of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/6/c76ef142bfaaa5a50249c625ffdcd74b8a897c90.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{015}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"39\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AIME_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/f/36f73fc1312ee0349b3f3a0f3bd9eb5504339011.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> be equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/6/3068e9b6cccbef13231bc541f1d2643a6c87ca49.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15 - \\varepsilon$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"51\" height=\"15\" />, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/a/e2a63918a6fa75b62ad87ad17aaf65f782d71546.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\varepsilon$\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\" /> is an almost neglectable value. Because of the small value <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/a/e2a63918a6fa75b62ad87ad17aaf65f782d71546.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\varepsilon$\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\" />, the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Domain\" title=\"Domain\">domain</a> of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/6/c96dd6ec1dc4ad7520fbdc78fcdbec9edd068d0c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"37\" height=\"20\" /> is basically the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Set\" title=\"Set\">set</a> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/e/f/9efb04e0e15c8c775458b936a047ecc9010ce6cd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"${15}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"17\" height=\"13\" />. plugging in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/9/f1965fae079a9ba2c0726c307070c2355dfcb213.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/2/9/72973d2bef563057ff898da7e29a007ad8c1b5da.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\varepsilon + 0 + 15 - \\varepsilon$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"113\" height=\"15\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/9/f1965fae079a9ba2c0726c307070c2355dfcb213.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, so the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/6/c76ef142bfaaa5a50249c625ffdcd74b8a897c90.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{015}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"39\" height=\"23\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AIME_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AIME\" title=\"1983 AIME\">1983 AIME </a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AIME_Problems\" title=\"1983 AIME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AIME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1983 AIME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=45&amp;year=1983\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AIME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1983 AIME Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AIME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1983 AIME Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AIME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1983 AIME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AIME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1983 AIME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AIME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1983 AIME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AIME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1983 AIME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AIME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1983 AIME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AIME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1983 AIME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AIME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1983 AIME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AIME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1983 AIME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AIME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1983 AIME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AIME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1983 AIME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AIME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1983 AIME Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AIME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1983 AIME Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AIME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1983 AIME Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AIME_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1983 AIME Problems/Problem 15\">15</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AIME_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AIME Problems and Solutions\"> All AIME Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017040923\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.030 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.049 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 191/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1766/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 88/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 3882/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   12.542      1 -total\n 59.89%    7.511      1 Template:AIME_box\n 38.45%    4.822      1 Template:MAA_Notice\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:2759:|#